            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Nowhere? (nusquam.) From all sides? (undique.) Here and there? (passim.) Upwards? (sūrsum.) Downwards? (deorsum.) Even as? (sīcut.) As? (velut.) If only? (utinam.) On the contrary? (immō.) At least? (saltem.) Wonderful? (mīrus, mīra, mīrum.) Different? (dīversus, dīversa, dīversum.) Similar? (similis, simile.) Fair? (iūstus, iūsta, iūstum.) Unjust? (iniūstus, iniūsta, iniūstum.) Fat? (pinguis, pingue.) Clever? (callidus, callida, callidum.) Special? (praecipuus, praecipua, praecipuum.) Former? (prīstinus, prīstina, prīstinum.) Nearest? (proximus, proxima, proximum.)"
            }
